{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits","id":688628,"title":"VASCU and ghosts/spirits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-04T12:56:36-07:00","id":688628,"title":"VASCU and ghosts/spirits","content":"Has anyone ever tried to run a game with VASCU hunters investigating occult phenomenoms and hunting mostly ghosts and spirits? Did that work well? (Ignoring the entire serial killer angle)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T00:07:33-07:00","id":689382,"title":"","content":"While I can't say I've run it, the concept does make some sense. Odds are a lot of murders should at least equal one or two ghosts, and in connection to serial murder VASCU will probably send a pair of agents to look into why that a house connected to a string of serial murders keeps seeping blood from the kitchen sink under the guise of &quot;looking up a lead&quot;. But VASCU is the one conspiracy that is probably least equipped to handle ghostly phenomena in terms of understanding, so either the agents in question would either need to start reading up on what a ghost does, or call up a contact who can teach them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T00:30:54-07:00","id":689395,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hunting&quot; Ghosts is all about investigation and VASCU are great at that. If you have some excuse to send them in, from a serial murder like flyboy suggested, to an Agent who's just curious they should do fine.<br /> <br /> I imagine that getting some good occult info on Ghosts is fairly easy in the WoD since they're common and aren't running a conspiracy of silence","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T01:35:22-07:00","id":689468,"title":"","content":"Their benedictions though are great in investigating the background of the ghost, especially if you allow the emotion reading part to be applied to areas as well. All they need is a picture and time to track down all the electronic records in existence <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4560-madfox11","name":"Madfox11","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T03:22:08-07:00","id":689531,"title":"","content":"Psychic agents and ghosts/spirits just makes sense to me. A lot of murders are probably done by spirit-ridden, or have caused a loci or could have caused a ghost. The VASCU powers are great for investgating such a thing and I just assume that in my version of the WoD they know something about the spirit world and ghost. Just because I say so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T07:04:21-07:00","id":689662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jan Paparazzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=689531#post689531\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Psychic agents and ghosts/spirits just makes sense to me. A lot of murders are probably done by spirit-ridden, or have caused a loci or could have caused a ghost. The VASCU powers are great for investgating such a thing and I just assume that in my version of the WoD they know something about the spirit world and ghost. Just because I say so.</div> </div> </div> </div>I always read that VASCU and TF:V always had issues with dealing with things in Twilight.<br /> <br /> However, considering that solving cases is what VASCU does, I can now easily see them having more expertise and ironically, being more effective in dealing with the issues of Spirits and Ghosts than TF:V.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T08:57:37-07:00","id":689768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=689662#post689662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I always read that VASCU and TF:V always had issues with dealing with things in Twilight.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think &quot;Etheric Rounds&quot; summarizes how TF:V deals with things in Twilight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 10-05-2015, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T10:41:29-07:00","id":689897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=689768#post689768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think &quot;Etheric Rounds&quot; summarizes how TF:V deals with thing in Twilight.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was my first thought as well. However, putting bullets into spirits and the like doesn't solve them, it merely suppresses them.<br /> <br /> Even Forsaken packs have issues with this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T13:38:20-07:00","id":690284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=689897#post689897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That was my first thought as well. However, putting bullets into spirits and the like doesn't solve them, it merely suppresses them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder how appropriate the phrase &quot;Good enough for Government work&quot; is here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T14:54:11-07:00","id":690426,"title":"","content":"Ghosts are at least easier, you just need to destroy the anchors. Sometimes it can be difficult but not always. I like to imagine there's some department of very tired government workers who are occasionally sent out to box anchors and bring them back to a warehouse in the middle of nowhere with all the others that have been collected over the years.<br /> <br /> The Talbot Group, which is essentially a Werewolf-to-Human Conversion organization, has a very loose understanding of loci and how spirits hang around them. They've taken to destroying certain 'spiritually charged' places, which can get the work done for some spirit stuff. I imagine the government has at least that basic level of understanding and a hunter conspiracy enmeshed in it can speed along requests to use eminent domain to claim private properties, raze them and put up a park or something.<br /> <br /> VASCU has probably dealt with more than a few serial killers who claim to be possessed by another, dead, serial killer or influenced by a ravening spirit. Unfortunately if they're not tied to a specific location just dealing with the host is going to lead to the problem popping up again at some point. VASCU probably has some flagged files to look at just in case someone claims they're the incarnation of Lizzie Borden or the herald of the Running Hate, to check and see if they are doing things similarly enough that there might be a connection and, if so, how the last hosts were caught.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-05-2015, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T19:09:44-07:00","id":690746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=690426#post690426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ghosts are at least easier, you just need to destroy the anchors. Sometimes it can be difficult but not always. I like to imagine there's some department of very tired government workers who are occasionally sent out to box anchors and bring them back to a warehouse in the middle of nowhere with all the others that have been collected over the years.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice plot location. Warehouse of the Damned. I do wonder what all the ghosts in such close proximity would get up to. It would end up as effectively a &quot;ghost town&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T01:29:17-07:00","id":690965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=690746#post690746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nice plot location. Warehouse of the Damned. I do wonder what all the ghosts in such close proximity would get up to. It would end up as effectively a &quot;ghost town&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Warehouse 13 makes a lot of sense in WoD... although the USA government might not be the conspiracy behind that <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4560-madfox11","name":"Madfox11","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T15:16:57-07:00","id":691751,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=690426#post690426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">VASCU has probably dealt with more than a few serial killers who claim to be possessed by another, dead, serial killer or influenced by a ravening spirit. Unfortunately if they're not tied to a specific location just dealing with the host is going to lead to the problem popping up again at some point. VASCU probably has some flagged files to look at just in case someone claims they're the incarnation of Lizzie Borden or the herald of the Running Hate, to check and see if they are doing things similarly enough that there might be a connection and, if so, how the last hosts were caught.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I guess I just deviate a little from canon by making VASCU ghost/spirit specific, ditch the serial killer focus and ditch all the other supernaturals as well and voil\u00e0: that sounds like a setting to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T15:46:44-07:00","id":691758,"title":"","content":"I don't know. Their power set seems more Human focused to me. Ghosts, sure; spirits, likely not as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T15:53:45-07:00","id":691766,"title":"","content":"It does leave the question of how and why an FBI group is tracking ghosts/spirits. The serial killer angle gives them an easy reason for what they're doing as well as an easy justification for how they become involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T16:22:23-07:00","id":691779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jan Paparazzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=691751#post691751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, I guess I just deviate a little from canon by making VASCU ghost/spirit specific, ditch the serial killer focus and ditch all the other supernaturals as well and voil\u00e0: that sounds like a setting to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>How does thIs VASCU get away with that in the budget hearings then? What's their mundane cover for the rest of the world?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T20:08:48-07:00","id":691913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=691766#post691766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does leave the question of how and why an FBI group is tracking ghosts/spirits. The serial killer angle gives them an easy reason for what they're doing as well as an easy justification for how they become involved.</div> </div> </div> </div>I prefer the idea of a Homeland Security team intended to deal with &quot;non-material insurgents&quot;, maybe even a subset of the DEA who tracks down drug-related spirits in an attempt to curb their influence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-07T14:33:01-07:00","id":692921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=691766#post691766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does leave the question of how and why an FBI group is tracking ghosts/spirits. The serial killer angle gives them an easy reason for what they're doing as well as an easy justification for how they become involved.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah I will still use the serial killer angle as a cover for what they are doing. I just want to use psychic agents going after spirits. Conflicts will be the agents investigating the cases involving spirits using their senses, just like <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millennium_(TV_series)\" target=\"_blank\">Millennium</a> for example. Other conflicts will be between VASCU and other groups who want to deal with the spirits differently, like worshipping them or trying to control them for their own good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-07T15:10:04-07:00","id":692960,"title":"","content":"What are government investigators going to do about spirits, though? Getting rid of them is something even werewolves have trouble with, and they can jump across worlds and attack them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T16:10:56-07:00","id":695430,"title":"","content":"Uhhhm ... because I think it's a cool idea? No seriously, to keep it under control and out of sight? I can see things spiraling out of control pretty easily with all the stuff leaving marks, which attracts more spirits eating off the barrier, some spirits slip through, that leads to trouble, creating more loci etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T18:30:53-07:00","id":695577,"title":"","content":"I wasn't attacking your idea, or asking why. I think it's a cool idea too.<br /> <br /> I just meant when they do realize something is being caused by a spirit, and track it down to its source, like a possessed person or just a place they hang around, what would they do with the spirit? Like, you can't imprison them as easy as you might a ghost by locking up their anchor. And you can't kill them cause they'd just go into the shadow world and pop up somewhere else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T23:14:21-07:00","id":695763,"title":"","content":"I have idea what would VASCU do with spirit - they would track him and...<br /> <br /> Bound it to serial killer! That way they could take out they new threat based on the paradigm they know enough about ( hunting killers ). And they created new Claimed - <i>voila</i>!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-10T10:53:31-07:00","id":696247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=695763#post695763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have idea what would VASCU do with spirit - they would track him and...Bound it to serial killer! That way they could take out they new threat based on the paradigm they know enough about ( hunting killers ). And they created new Claimed - <i>voila</i>!</div> </div> </div> </div>But if they kill the Claimed, the spirit can just detach from the body and move on.<br /> <br /> Unless you're suggesting this is how they maintain their jobs, by 'making' serial killers and putting them down knowing they'll come back when the spirit claims someone else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-10-2015, 01:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-10T17:51:21-07:00","id":696635,"title":"","content":"Vanguard isn't in the habit of killing their targets, their bosses at the FBI get all frowny face at vigilante justice.<br /> <br /> I would presume, since they have a super ultra supremo grande prison for serial killer supernaturals, that there are Vanguard agents with more active talents for capturing supernaturals and keeping them captured.<br /> <br /> While I imagine mindwhammying ghosts and spirits would be harder, I don't think it would be impossible.<br /> <br /> And if this idea doesn't work for you, then have Vanguard grit their teeth and call in a Valkyrie strike team.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 10-10-2015, 08:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-11T05:17:32-07:00","id":696951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=695577#post695577\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wasn't attacking your idea, or asking why. I think it's a cool idea too.<br /> <br /> I just meant when they do realize something is being caused by a spirit, and track it down to its source, like a possessed person or just a place they hang around, what would they do with the spirit? Like, you can't imprison them as easy as you might a ghost by locking up their anchor. And you can't kill them cause they'd just go into the shadow world and pop up somewhere else.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah. I was still puzzling on that. I thought I could either use VASCU, or Task Force Valkyrie, or maybe use the Book of Spirits in combination with regular cops (13th Precinct). Or maybe VASCU/TFV in combination with some of those merits from chapter 3 Book of Spirits. It does make me spread out across a number of books though to bring it all together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T02:18:54-07:00","id":714039,"title":"","content":"So how do mortals deal with spirits in general? Get them with their bans? Or simply run or avoid them? I mean the mortals line is asking for ghost stories with spirits involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T05:12:50-07:00","id":714211,"title":"","content":"In the books they seem to get claimed or ridden or dead or make a deal. Alternatively, they can seek out help, the requests might eventually make their way back to a werewolf or mage or occultist. If they're of player-level ability, they might be able to deal with it themselves, through bans and basic magic wards, like salt and protective amulets and incense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-22-2015, 08:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T01:00:51-07:00","id":718032,"title":"","content":"Alternately, they destroy/deal with whatever lured the spirit into the area in the first place. Admittedly, once a powerful spirit is there it might be a tad hard to do so, but who said it would be easy? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> (It is the prime way on how the source of the Alligator in the Sewers problem can be dealt with by mortals.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4560-madfox11","name":"Madfox11","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-14T04:34:53-08:00","id":765478,"title":"","content":"Ok that would work. Great, thanks! One thing I did change for this type of paranormal investigation game is I changed the default splat from VASCU to Null Mysteriis. That makes the most sense. The rest of the splats are more interested in killing monsters than investigating them and uncovering new information. I move some of the other splats to the antagonists slots I have in my setting. So instead of joining up together to kill some monsters, it becomes more of an occult detective game with spirits and some other organisations who all interact with spirits for different reasons. Like the Loyalists of Thule or the Aegis Kai Doru maybe want to bind spirits to magical items to use for their personal gain and that would make them an enemy for my group, just as much as the spirits themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-14T10:17:50-08:00","id":765637,"title":"","content":"Aegis Kai Doru, maybe. Loyalists seem to be largely <i>against</i> that kind of thing (haunted by their past, and all), though renegades amongst their number might. Might offer a tense teamwork situation - after group A earns the PCs enimity, along comes group B accusing A of being traitors and wanting to team up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T08:41:12-08:00","id":772332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=690284#post690284\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I wonder how appropriate the phrase &quot;Good enough for Government work&quot; is here.</div> </div> </div> </div> You win the Interwebz!\u200b<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This is just my bright, shiny two cents.<br /> <br /> Here's the thing. I try not to argue in forums. It's like pouring concrete in a river. It doesn't get you anywhere in the short term and it poisons the environment long term.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2668-asmenedas","name":"Asmenedas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2668_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T16:11:55-08:00","id":781915,"title":"","content":"One thing that seems to be overlooked here is that the VASCU actually have Endowments that can directly interact with ghosts. The first 4 abilities under the Interview tree of Teleinformatics can allow them to directly interface with ghosts. Bear in mind I said &quot;interface&quot; not &quot;destroy&quot; or &quot;exorcise&quot; (which brings to mind the fact that Malleus Mallefecarum might be the most appropriate Conspiracy to deal with ghosts). Interfacing with ghosts would make for some interesting role play. Ghosts still have minds and are able to think therefore any abilities related to mind reading should have just as much of an effect on them as spirit magic.<br /> <br /> &quot;Just One More Thing&quot; allows agents to &quot;hear&quot; up to two or three words associated with a pang of guilt, or just the question that the suspect being questioned doesn't want asked. With ghosts this can be worked to include not just guilt, but things they are attached to, or painful moments for them.<br /> &quot;Polygraph&quot; allows the agent to tune in to the frequency of a person and read their emotions off the surface of their mind. Ghosts are VERY emotional beings. While this ability may be geared towards giving a bonus to detecting a lie, it is also useful in interviewing a ghost to directly gauge the ghost's responses to certain questions and see which direction the inquiry should go in.<br /> &quot;Synchronization&quot; pretty much allows an agent to read a subject's mind like an open book. This should be no different for ghosts. As long as an agent can mentally get a lock on a ghost, they should be able to use this skill and answer questions like &quot;How do I make the killing stop?&quot; and &quot;What needs to be done to make you cross over?&quot;<br /> &quot;The Talon&quot; while being geared towards making a suspect confess to a crime, is also the only ability the VASCU have to directly attack ghosts with. Besides triggering guilt and shame in the ghost and making it suffer penalties on mental and social rolls, an agent that scores a critical success on using The Talon can do two points of damage directly to a ghost's corpus. Admittingly this isn't the most efficient way of combating a harmful ghost, but there it is. The only actual weapon in a VASCU agent's arsenal against ghosts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10065-zolace","name":"Zolace","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T02:06:17-08:00","id":782157,"title":"","content":"I have a question about VASCU and while it does not directly relate to ephemeral beings, it could be relevant.<br /> It has been stated (multiple times) that the Wintergreen process does not create psychics and Teleinformics is incompatible with actual psychic powers...so what is it? Recent thought credits the God-Machine (which impiles Angels could interface with VASCU in disturbing ways and potentially adds the Unchained to their 'most wanted list), but there is no evidence since the God-Machine Chronicle release.<br /> <br /> On the matter of 'warehouse of ghost anchors', I am obliged to remind you that VASCU aims to imprisons the targets rather than kill them. Supernaturals tend to get a top secret 'super-duper max' prison and I can differently see a specialized section of ghosts. Then again, 'ghost-prison' just sounds appealing...and if the deceased criminals get transferred to a TF: V facility which has people learing how to use etheric rounds, well that is just tragic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T08:44:23-08:00","id":785413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/688628-vascu-and-ghosts-spirits?p=782157#post782157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a question about VASCU and while it does not directly relate to ephemeral beings, it could be relevant.<br /> It has been stated (multiple times) that the Wintergreen process does not create psychics and Teleinformics is incompatible with actual psychic powers...so what is it?</div> </div> </div> </div>It has been mentioned in the Slasher book that Teleinformatics is an extension of the human brain's ability to process information. Though there are some Teleinformatics abilities that obviously go beyond mere information processing. So beyond &quot;information processing&quot; and &quot;psychic abilities&quot; your guess is as good as mine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10065-zolace","name":"Zolace","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}